Service stress::D1_ConfirmationDense
{
    pattern: '/stress/d1';
    documentation: 'Dense stack on ops::Confirmation: several distinct navigation chains plus whatever the model offers along them, with a filter, a sort and a limit. Generated from the model by scripts/corpus/stacks.py, so it deepens as the model does rather than needing a new hand-written service per domain.';
